Changes made: the IdeaScientist ideation harness (role prompts, artifact
schemas, orchestration loop, validity gates and evaluation rubrics) was
rewritten and adapted into a Claude skill, with live web retrieval in place of
the offline Idea Vault and without the reinforcement-learning training. See
idea-scientist/NOTICE.md for details.

